  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 302.29 Prescribed filing date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.29 “Prescribed filing date” means the date, pursuant to the road toll law and these rules, on which reports are to be filed with the administration.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; renumbered by #10753 (formerly Saf-C 302.22); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.26)",
